  "It's important to maintain consistency across our code base, so I want you to pay attention to this.",
  "When naming variables, I need you to always end the name with '_m'.",
  "This is a convention we use to easily identify and distinguish our variables.\"",
  "Consistency is key in collaborative coding environments, and it's one of the things we value highly here at LEAP.",
  "I trust that you'll get used to this quickly and won't need reminders.\"",
  "For now, I want you to familiarize yourself with our coding standards and review some of the existing code to get a feel for our practices.",
  "For most routine visits, you won't need prior authorization or referrals.",
  "You simply present your insurance card at the time of service.",
  "Absolutely.",
  "Now, in terms of social security, you'll want to understand how your contributions work and what they entail.",
  "And don't hesitate to reach out to our HR department if you have any specific questions or concerns about your benefits.",
  "\"Precisely.",
  "Keep that in mind, and you'll continue to thrive here.\"",
  "Oliver, now that you're getting more involved in remote work, I want to emphasize the importance of security.",
  "Now, one of the things I want to impress upon you is to never use a VPN when accessing company resources remotely.",
  "It's a strict policy we have, and for good reason.",
  "They can be, in certain contexts.",
  "But in our line of work, VPNs can actually introduce unnecessary risks and complications."
 ],
